 "strings": {
  "\"Find me in Tosa.\"": "",
  "They'll put everything on the line\nto lure Sakamoto Ryoma to Omiya.": "",
  "To his surprise, the allies he's made\nalong the way reach out to help.": "",
  "And though he's changed, it's revealed\nto be none other than Takechi Hanpeita.": "",
  "As ordered, Todo Heisuke had\ninfiltrated the Goryo Eji.": "",
  "So many allies lost.": "",
  "And in the end, he gave his life.": "",
  "Thanks to everyone's sacrifices,": "",
  "Following a bitter reunion, Takechi\nleaves Ryoma with these simple words.": "",
  "The time to settle everything draws near.": "",
  "Kondo Isami's final move was revealed.": "",
  "Ryoma now knows that\nChoshu, Satsuma, and Tosa plan to meet.": "",
  "Ryoma finally learns the truth\nabout the man masquerading as him.": "",
  "Well... 'bout time we kissed\nthis place goodbye, eh?": "",
  "Hajime-chan?": "",
  "You all set to go to Tosa?": "",
  "I'm sure he's there.": "",
  "He'll be waiting for me.": "",
  "So that's Tosa, is it?": "",
  "That's really Tosa!?": "",
  "That's not the Tosa I know.": "",
  "It's like he said...": "",
  "Comin' up on Tosa.": "",
  "What's happened to you?": "",
  "Any ideas where to look, Hajime-chan?": "",
  "Wait a minute...": "",
  "The hell am I lookin' at?": "",
  "The place where it all began...": "",
  "Tosa's still pretty big, eh?": "",
  "Tosa...": "",
  "Takechi could be damn near anywhere.": "",
  "Looks more like a fortress.": "",
  "It's coming into view.": "",
  "It's all up to you.": "",
  "If I were to guess, I'd say that's\nyou and Takechi...": "",
  "If I know Takechi...": "",
  "Bring this mayhem to an end, yeah?": "",
  "And here ya are a year later,\nmarchin' your way back in.": "",
  "And if that's true...": "",
  "He'll know we're coming.": "",
  "This is where I lost Toyo-san...": "",
  "It all started right here.　": "",
  "Face to face they stand.\nHeart and mind like a clear stream. A mirror image. ": "",
  "That's our target...": "",
  "Then you're the only one\nwho can stop him.": "",
  "It's not unlike myself and Kondo-san.": "",
  "Let's go.": "",
  "It's why I left Tosa.": "",
  "Guess that's what they call fate.": "",
  "We'll find him at Kochi Castle.": "",
  "We're taking Kochi Castle!": "",
  "You're right.": "",
  "That day Pops had to choose...": "",
  "Because of you, I was forced\nto use my ace in the hole.": "",
  "You mean Oryo?": "",
  "How could you...?": "",
  "Even your little plan with\nSatsuma and Choshu was a plus.": "",
  "and you're not the type to just sit around.": "",
  "Pops was going to leave the whole\nTosa Loyalist Party to you.": "",
  "I traced your every last move.": "",
  "I swear, you never change.": "",
  "And that's why you had him killed...?": "",
  "In the end, you're just like Pops.": "",
  "and with it, I offered you a challenge.": "",
  "The world isn't kind to people like you and Pops.\nIt just wouldn't have worked.": "",
  "You remember this place?": "",
  "It was just the spark needed to bring\nthis country to the brink of total war.": "",
  "Tosa's changed a lot since then,": "",
  "I knew you wouldn't understand,\neven if I spelled it out for you.": "",
  "and it's time for the two of us\nto determine what that is.": "",
  "I did whatever I had to do.": "",
  "I confess, every time you say it,": "",
  "so I did what was necessary.": "",
  "So that was it...": "",
  "And for once in my life,": "",
  "Or, rather...": "",
  "Both him": "",
  "And I could never forgive Pops for\ntrying to leave Tosa to you, of all people.": "",
  "You expect me to believe that!?": "",
  "To settle it like this...": "",
  "My calling you here is a means to an end.": "",
  "Don't you see?": "",
  "But one obstacle stood in his way,": "",
  "Still,": "",
  "but this place is exactly the same.": "",
  "But, of course, you overcame even that.": "",
  "But Pops never would've seen things my way.": "",
  "but he was too obsessed with the method.": "",
  "No matter the circumstances,\nyou never changed. Not once.": "",
  "One thing's for certain—": "",
  "It's to reach an answer.\nTo know which of us is right.": "",
  "You really think that's right?": "",
  "To think you managed to kill Izo, too.": "",
  "If you really want to bring about change,\nyou can't think about the cost.": "",
  "none of that matters now.": "",
  "There was one way to save Tosa.": "",
  "The Kyo fire.": "",
  "You'll sacrifice everything for the sake of others,": "",
  "and it was none other than Pops himself.": "",
  "Would you like to know why?": "",
  "I made sure of it.": "",
  "It was never me.": "",
  "It's just you and me.": "",
  "I'll tell you...": "",
  "This past year holds the answer,": "",
  "As I see it, nothing could be more right.": "",
  "I couldn't allow you to be so naive.": "",
  "That's when I took your name...": "",
  "If I win, I carry on.": "",
  "I can prove myself righteous.": "",
  "Brother.": "",
  "Brother, huh?": "",
  "Everything was going just fine.": "",
  "I told you already.": "",
  "Will he be the man who walked\nthe same path as Yoshida Toyo?": "",
  "What will they say about Sakamoto Ryoma?": "",
  "History can't have two Sakamoto Ryomas.": "",
  "I took the name Sakamoto Ryoma,": "",
  "From that moment, I was Sakamoto Ryoma.": "",
  "Sakamoto Ryoma will be etched in time\nas the man who changed everything.": "",
  "I never imagined you'd restore imperial rule.": "",
  "and that innkeeper girl of yours.": "",
  "How could I not?": "",
  "it stirs within my heart": "",
  "Did you think I'd forget?": "",
  "You killed Pops to fulfill his wishes?": "",
  "You also forgave the woman you love\nfor betraying you.": "",
  "Ah, that takes me back.": "",
  "but when it comes to yourself, you're clueless.": "",
  "A challenge?": "",
  "You being Shinsengumi, news of\nanother Ryoma was bound to find you,": "",
  "Yamazaki saw to that.": "",
  "At last, we can settle things properly.": "",
  "So you've come.": "",
  "Will he be the man who rewrote history\nat the edge of a sword?": "",
  "So you had no idea, hm?": "",
  "and it's a warmth unlike any other.": "",
  "You know, this started around\nthe time I hired Serizawa Kamo.": "",
  "I'll lead this country down\na trail of blood.": "",
  "\"Let no blood be spilled,\" right?": "",
  "It's where we lost Pops.": "",
  "He dreamed of changing Tosa for the better,": "",
  "In order for him to fulfill his wishes...": "",
  "We were raised to serve him and his dream,": "",
  "Whether that's you or me won't make any\ndifference. Wouldn't you agree?": "",
  "So you could be the one in charge?": "",
  "He had to die.": "",
  "Nobody can get in our way.": "",
  "Revolutions will always require bloodshed.": "",
  "You're out of your damn mind.": "",
  "Let's help it along.": "",
  "Yeah...": "",
  "He's planning...　": "",
  "Even back then...": "",
  "Since then, he's used both myself\nand the Bakufu's Katsu Rintaro.": "",
  "is all for his plan.": "",
  "Did you forget?": "",
  "The only thing you're after\nis a cushy throne.": "",
  "There's still a heart in there.": "",
  "You're my brother always.": "",
  "I forgive you.": "",
  "You're wrong.": "",
  "but despite that, I started using those\nvery things to try and get what I want.": "",
  "Well, your performance\ncertainly was something.": "",
  "No, the entirety of Shikoku! So please!": "",
  "More than that.": "",
  "So, you're <i>the</i> Sakamoto Ryoma.": "",
  "You didn't think I wouldn't\nsee this coming, now, did you?": "",
  "It isn't determined by you or me.": "",
  "Your love moved me,": "",
  "I mean, if I can't see through you,": "",
  "The hell do you know!?": "",
  "you chose, unconditionally,\nto protect me, no matter what.　": "",
  "Are you going to kneel for me too?": "",
  "If you were smart, you'd shut your mouths\nand let me handle things!": "",
  "You want Tosa, you can have it—": "",
  "Whose voices we've never heard.": "",
  "You're crawlin' in your grave.": "",
  "Nor by anyone else here.": "",
  "I am that man!": "",
  "I've prioritized this country's survival\nmore than anyone else!": "",
  "For the country, you mean.\nHe wants to start a war.": "",
  "And as for Japan...": "",
  "Know what's really necessary.": "",
  "You're the last person we'd need help from.": "",
  "then how on earth am I supposed to\nfool the country, huh?": "",
  "We have to believe in this country.": "",
  "Our future's secure...": "",
  "This country walks its own path.": "",
  "He plans to...": "",
  "to take this country and sell it for all it's worth...": "",
  "Your little stunt helped us\nkeep this place in mint condition.": "",
  "Tosa's got no business being a weapon,": "",
  "You see this...?": "",
  "I swear, you just can't trust the ones\nwho claw their way up.": "",
  "All right, let's get out of here.": "",
  "Who knows?": "",
  "I left Tosa behind": "",
  "You've always been looking out for me.": "",
  "It's only right!": "",
  "And to make matters worse,": "",
  "I was just too slow to realize it.": "",
  "That's the best I can do.": "",
  "You know, hearing it back,\nit makes a lot of sense.": "",
  "Naturally...": "",
  "You gonna tell me that's not love?": "",
  "No matter what happens...": "",
  "and of course,": "",
  "All that matters,": "",
  "This is Japan.": "",
  "Honestly...": "",
  "You keep saying this name...": "",
  "We might lose everything,": "",
  "Believe me when I say...": "",
  "But that wasn't...　": "",
  "Ironic. I wanted nothing more than to\ntear down ranks and hierarchy,": "",
  "Do it!": "",
  "In other words, it looks like we'll see\nan end to this class nonsense after all!": "",
  "Still...": "",
  "What are you talking about?": "",
  "What's wrong?": "",
  "It doesn't matter who's right,": "",
  "There will always be pain,": "",
  "What are you talking about!?": "",
  "Then, I'll do the honors.": "",
  "Hah, do you hear yourself!?\nYour confidence will be your downfall!": "",
  "Are you nuts!?": "",
  "This has to stop!": "",
  "Tomorrow is yours!": "",
  "Well, I'm sure it has a lot more blood to spill.": "",
  "Our future brethren will see to that.": "",
  "It turns out it wasn't me who was meant\nto change things around here.": "",
  "So, no more bloodshed.": "",
  "You asked him to watch over me,\njust in case.": "",
  "I let someone more powerful use me\nhowever they pleased.": "",
  "No, stop! Stop it right now!": "",
  "Cut it out!": "",
  "No! Stay back!": "",
  "Take a good, long look.": "",
  "You <i>must</i> listen to me, Sakamoto!": "",
  "Well, I'm nothing like you goshi,\nflailing about from day to day!": "",
  "We helped him get weapons\nand ammunition from the British.": "",
  "to the British!": "",
  "We're merely becoming a part of Britain.": "",
  "So what about the British fleet?": "",
  "I rather like the British.\nVery rational people, you know.": "",
  "It's time for me to clean up my mess.": "",
  "Who knows what'll happen\nto this country if I die!": "",
  "We've said goodbye to the lives we knew.": "",
  "Our time is up.": ""
 },
 "ref_ja": {
  "\"Find me in Tosa.\"": "「土佐で待つ」",
  "They'll put everything on the line\nto lure Sakamoto Ryoma to Omiya.": "「坂本龍馬」を\n近江屋へおびき出すべく力を合わせる",
  "To his surprise, the allies he's made\nalong the way reach out to help.": "そして　長い旅の途中で生まれた仲間たちが集い",
  "And though he's changed, it's revealed\nto be none other than Takechi Hanpeita.": "それは　変わり果てた武市半平太だった",
  "As ordered, Todo Heisuke had\ninfiltrated the Goryo Eji.": "それは　藤堂平助を\n「御陵衛士」に潜入させることだった",
  "So many allies lost.": "倒れる仲間たち",
  "And in the end, he gave his life.": "命を賭した藤堂の働きで",
  "Thanks to everyone's sacrifices,": "多くの犠牲を重ね",
  "Following a bitter reunion, Takechi\nleaves Ryoma with these simple words.": "武市はその言葉を残し\n龍馬のもとを去るのだった",
  "The time to settle everything draws near.": "決着のときは　近い",
  "Kondo Isami's final move was revealed.": "近藤勇が残した“最後の策”",
  "Ryoma now knows that\nChoshu, Satsuma, and Tosa plan to meet.": "長州　薩摩　土佐の代表が\n一堂に集うことを知る龍馬たち",
  "Ryoma finally learns the truth\nabout the man masquerading as him.": "龍馬はついに\n“もう一人の坂本龍馬”の正体を知る",
  "Well... 'bout time we kissed\nthis place goodbye, eh?": "もう　京の街ともお別れやな",
  "Hajime-chan?": "一（はじめ）ちゃん",
  "You all set to go to Tosa?": "土佐に行く準備はできとんのか",
  "I'm sure he's there.": "あの場所で",
  "He'll be waiting for me.": "あの場所で待っている",
  "So that's Tosa, is it?": "あれが土佐か",
  "That's really Tosa!?": "あれが土佐なんか！？",
  "That's not the Tosa I know.": "あれは俺が知っている土佐じゃない",
  "It's like he said...": "きっとあいつは",
  "Comin' up on Tosa.": "そろそろ　土佐やな",
  "What's happened to you?": "一体何があったんだ……",
  "Any ideas where to look, Hajime-chan?": "一（はじめ）ちゃん　アテはあるんか？",
  "Wait a minute...": "何だあれは……",
  "The hell am I lookin' at?": "何やあれは",
  "The place where it all began...": "俺たちの運命の歯車が狂った",
  "Tosa's still pretty big, eh?": "土佐いうても広いで",
  "Tosa...": "土佐に……",
  "Takechi could be damn near anywhere.": "武市はどこにおるんや",
  "Looks more like a fortress.": "要塞のような街やな",
  "It's coming into view.": "見えてきたな",
  "It's all up to you.": "お前しかおらん",
  "If I were to guess, I'd say that's\nyou and Takechi...": "きっと君と武市は\n互いに見えているものが同じ……",
  "If I know Takechi...": "きっと武市は",
  "Bring this mayhem to an end, yeah?": "この闘いに　終止符を打てんのは",
  "And here ya are a year later,\nmarchin' your way back in.": "そして１年\nまたここに戻ってきたっちゅうわけか",
  "And if that's true...": "だとしたら",
  "He'll know we're coming.": "俺たちがやってくるのをな",
  "This is where I lost Toyo-san...": "俺は東洋の親っさんを失い",
  "It all started right here.　": "全てはあの場所で始まった　",
  "Face to face they stand.\nHeart and mind like a clear stream. A mirror image. ": "差し向かう　心は清き　水鏡 ",
  "That's our target...": "敵は",
  "Then you're the only one\nwho can stop him.": "武市を止められるのは君しかいない",
  "It's not unlike myself and Kondo-san.": "私と近藤さんのようなものなのだろう",
  "Let's go.": "行くぞ",
  "It's why I left Tosa.": "逃げるように土佐を出た",
  "Guess that's what they call fate.": "運命っちゅうやつやな",
  "We'll find him at Kochi Castle.": "高知城で待っている",
  "We're taking Kochi Castle!": "高知城にあり！！",
  "You're right.": "ああ",
  "That day Pops had to choose...": "あの日親っさんはな",
  "Because of you, I was forced\nto use my ace in the hole.": "あれには\n俺も奥の手を使わざるを得なかった",
  "You mean Oryo?": "おりょうのことか",
  "How could you...?": "お前……",
  "Even your little plan with\nSatsuma and Choshu was a plus.": "お前が薩長の仲を\n取り持ったこともうまく利用して",
  "and you're not the type to just sit around.": "お前なら何もしないわけはない",
  "Pops was going to leave the whole\nTosa Loyalist Party to you.": "お前に土佐勤王党を託すつもりだったんだ",
  "I traced your every last move.": "お前の動きは逐一報告させたよ",
  "I swear, you never change.": "お前はそういう奴だ\n昔っから",
  "And that's why you had him killed...?": "お前は勤王党の盟主でいたいがために",
  "In the end, you're just like Pops.": "お前は親っさんによく似ているからな　",
  "and with it, I offered you a challenge.": "お前への挑戦状だったんだ",
  "The world isn't kind to people like you and Pops.\nIt just wouldn't have worked.": "お前や親っさんのような甘いやり方じゃ\n世の中は変わらないんだ",
  "You remember this place?": "ここを覚えてるか",
  "It was just the spark needed to bring\nthis country to the brink of total war.": "この国に倒幕戦争を引き起こす寸前まで\n持っていくこともできた",
  "Tosa's changed a lot since then,": "この１年で土佐は変わった",
  "I knew you wouldn't understand,\neven if I spelled it out for you.": "こんなことを言っても\nお前に理解されないのは分かってる",
  "and it's time for the two of us\nto determine what that is.": "その決着をつけるための\n時間だったということだ",
  "I did whatever I had to do.": "その為ならどんな手も使った",
  "I confess, every time you say it,": "その言葉を聞くと",
  "so I did what was necessary.": "その障害を排除するのは",
  "So that was it...": "それで",
  "And for once in my life,": "それで初めて……",
  "Or, rather...": "それとも",
  "Both him": "それに",
  "And I could never forgive Pops for\ntrying to leave Tosa to you, of all people.": "そんなお前に土佐を託そうとした親っさんもな",
  "You expect me to believe that!?": "そんなバカな話があるか！！",
  "To settle it like this...": "そんな勝負に",
  "My calling you here is a means to an end.": "だからお前をここへ呼び出したのさ",
  "Don't you see?": "だから俺は",
  "But one obstacle stood in his way,": "だから親っさんの意志を邪魔しているのは",
  "Still,": "だが",
  "but this place is exactly the same.": "だがここだけはあの日のままだ",
  "But, of course, you overcame even that.": "だがそれすらお前は乗り越えやがった",
  "But Pops never would've seen things my way.": "だが親っさんの考えは変わらなかった",
  "but he was too obsessed with the method.": "だが親っさんはその手段にこだわり過ぎた",
  "No matter the circumstances,\nyou never changed. Not once.": "どこまで行っても変わらねえよ　お前は",
  "One thing's for certain—": "どちらにせよ",
  "It's to reach an answer.\nTo know which of us is right.": "どっちが正しいのか　ケリをつけるためさ",
  "You really think that's right?": "どんな意味があるっていうんだ",
  "To think you managed to kill Izo, too.": "まさか本気の以蔵すら倒すとはな",
  "If you really want to bring about change,\nyou can't think about the cost.": "ましてこの国を変えようと本気で想うなら\n手段になどこだわってはいられない",
  "none of that matters now.": "もう戻ることなどできない",
  "There was one way to save Tosa.": "一介の郷士が土佐を……",
  "The Kyo fire.": "京へ火を",
  "You'll sacrifice everything for the sake of others,": "人のために自分を投げ出せちまうくせに",
  "and it was none other than Pops himself.": "他ならぬ親っさんの存在\nそのものだったんだよ",
  "Would you like to know why?": "何故だかわかるか？",
  "I made sure of it.": "俺がそうさせた",
  "It was never me.": "俺ではなく",
  "It's just you and me.": "俺とお前",
  "I'll tell you...": "俺とお前……",
  "This past year holds the answer,": "俺とお前のこの１年は",
  "As I see it, nothing could be more right.": "俺にとっちゃ\nそれが何よりも重要だったんだ",
  "I couldn't allow you to be so naive.": "俺はお前のそういう甘さが許せなかった",
  "That's when I took your name...": "俺はお前の名……",
  "If I win, I carry on.": "俺は俺の信念を貫き",
  "I can prove myself righteous.": "俺は俺の正しさを証明できる",
  "Brother.": "兄弟",
  "Brother, huh?": "兄弟か",
  "Everything was going just fine.": "全て上手くいっていた",
  "I told you already.": "前にも言ったはずだ",
  "Will he be the man who walked\nthe same path as Yoshida Toyo?": "吉田東洋と同じ道を歩んだ男として\n語り継がれるか",
  "What will they say about Sakamoto Ryoma?": "坂本龍馬という人間は",
  "History can't have two Sakamoto Ryomas.": "坂本龍馬として生きた男は",
  "I took the name Sakamoto Ryoma,": "坂本龍馬の名は",
  "From that moment, I was Sakamoto Ryoma.": "坂本龍馬の名を騙るようになった",
  "Sakamoto Ryoma will be etched in time\nas the man who changed everything.": "坂本龍馬は歴史を変えた男として名を刻む",
  "I never imagined you'd restore imperial rule.": "大政奉還まで成し遂げちまうとはな",
  "and that innkeeper girl of yours.": "宿屋の女を使ってな",
  "How could I not?": "当然のことだろ？",
  "it stirs within my heart": "心の底から",
  "Did you think I'd forget?": "忘れるわけがない",
  "You killed Pops to fulfill his wishes?": "意志を継ぐために殺すだと？",
  "You also forgave the woman you love\nfor betraying you.": "愛する女の裏切りさえ受け入れた",
  "Ah, that takes me back.": "懐かしい響きだ",
  "but when it comes to yourself, you're clueless.": "手前のこととなるとサッパリだ",
  "A challenge?": "挑戦状だと？",
